{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grizzly Golfers</strong> is a <strong>first-person multiplayer game about golfing with bears</strong> (or your friends).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hit the <strong>ball</strong>, hit your <strong>friends</strong>, or just mess around on <strong>crazy golf courses</strong>...\u00a0<strong>it\u2019s all up to you</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/the_game.png?t=1745847251\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through all kinds of wild <strong>levels</strong> with your friends, hit each other <strong>off the map</strong> with your golf club, or go solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You decide how you want to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to <strong>build</strong> a <strong>giant mega ramp</strong> and <strong>launch</strong> the <strong>ball</strong> through an insane map that you have <strong>build?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or a super long course that takes forever to complete?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go build your level in the <strong>built-in level editor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>the possibilities are endless!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/minigames2.png?t=1745847251\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">there will also be <strong>mini games</strong> in the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">such as <strong>street golf:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">street golf is a mini game where you have a <strong>highway</strong> with a hole in the middle.. and your goal is to be the first to get the ball in the hole</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>but watch out for the cars.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">also for those who want to do <strong>coop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">there are <strong>coop mini games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">such as <strong>big ball golf:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>hit the big ball</strong> into the big hole <strong>together</strong>. but be careful that your ball does not roll into the <strong>lava.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and there will be many more <strong>adventures</strong> to experience with your <strong>friends</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">but that is up to you and your friends</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/extras/bear3.png?t=1745847251\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672710?t=1745847251","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672710?t=1745847251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/109d69fe462024baa7a7ac21321cfc97e3a85b7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745847251","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672710/109d69fe462024baa7a7ac21321cfc97e3a85b7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745847251","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grizzly Golfers</strong> is a 